{"server":"cn","storyId":"act44side_level_act44side_st03","groupId":"act44side","stageId":"act44side_st03","title":"过客","storyCode":"AT-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"ef3070cc52702621c6a19fb6b9a0759f2c49b47c8c7f98cf7acba190bd5dc202","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_park"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她真就写了这么一句话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有必要骗你吗？她的信还在我这儿呢。要看吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（清嗓子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*龙门粗口*，我听说你爷爷被你气走了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有落款，全信完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这你也笑得出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，我不知道她字写快了居然有点像狂草。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，不是在她亲自把这封信拍在你脸上之后，事情就解释清楚了吗，“诗怀雅局长”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠！要不是那家伙还别别扭扭的，你看我找不找你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本来也不用你找。我们见面越少越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我宣布，你碗里最后一颗鳞丸归我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请便，就当是错怪你的赔罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可真轻描淡写啊，臭老鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你还想怎样？在新汐斯塔和你爷爷对着干，至少这事不能算我错怪你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你说......我是不是也该找星熊聊聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该，但是不合适。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我知道她最近要么躲着我，要么就一本正经地叫我官职，但其实我能看出来，我们俩并没有变生分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟发生了这么多事，她得避嫌，她错怪了我不好意思，还有，毕竟她那边也算是长辈去世......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她没那么敏感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？我觉得她偶尔也有点多愁善感......也不能这么说，嗯，我想想，怎么描述她那种状态呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等陈晖洁回来，说不定可以帮你一起想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的意思是说，她现在那副样子，可能根本就不是因为她想了那么多，只是单纯想拿你寻开心而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臭！老！鼠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"诗怀雅","speakerId":"avg_1033_swire2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊我知根知底，她才不像你，一百个心眼，老奸巨猾！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承蒙夸奖。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmenbridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢星熊督察帮我带的伴手礼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊督察去东国的这段时日，不知怎的，我竟然没少光顾那家姜齐煎饼店，吃到后来，竟然也觉得葱段味道很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，据说星熊督察在御机也遭逢不少变故，还能想着替我带东西，这份心意实在是弥足珍贵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我应该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说我在御机也惹了不少麻烦，万幸没闹到惊动夫人，惊动魏先生，让龙门难办那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有的事。我听说的都是你智勇双全，不仅洗脱自己的冤屈，还替情同义父的铁斋先生报仇的佳话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个金兵卫本来也不是善类，被捕受审是理所当然。星熊督察心存善念，没有下重手，这才是便宜了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......夫人，我还有一件事想问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必拘泥，问就是了。上次我在街上开快了一点，你别停我的时候也没这么扭扭捏捏的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从御机回来之后，其实一直在想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门和御机......究竟有何不同？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么我已经可以心安理得地说自己是龙门人，可御机对我而言，却无论如何也没法再当成一个家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为林先生对黑道管理有方？因为龙门没有所谓神明？不，原因不该是这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，一座城市里最重要的，只有人，一个一个的，生活在城市里的，活生生的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是人就会做梦，而一座城里的人在做什么样的梦，这座城市就会传颂什么样的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人是说......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御机在做的梦，龙门早已醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在你仍然在那边交了一些好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概是我这趟回御机最大的收获。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有收获，那不就很好嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好我也有件奇闻要跟督察分享。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说是和御机邻近的姬户城，最近出现了一名少年英侠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位侠客把容颜包得严严实实。明明刀法不怎么样，打人却只用一把木刀，还总能用不要命的招数克敌制胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可偏偏就是这么一位看起来不太能成事的少侠，解决了姬户城盘踞多年的诈骗团伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"据他自己说，他是从御机一路走到姬户的。他在姬户也不打算多待，休整几天，就要去下一个城市逛逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祝他一路顺利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一件事，没那么稀奇了，不过也算和星熊督察有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"御机有位被撤了职的警察，最近打算竞选议员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能选上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"九成九选不上。但成不了的事，就不去做了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，天也聊得差不多，煎饼也吃得差不多，是时候开始下一轮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夫人今天是换了新车没错，不过我的老伙计可未必会输。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾想，还没发动引擎，气势上就先被星熊督察压了一头啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"avg_npc_1645_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这身衣服的功劳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"avg_1044_hsgma2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百分之三十吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g11_odenstall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竹轮、白萝卜、驮兽筋。给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"演艺事务所张罗得怎么样了？还顺利吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有好有坏。不管怎么说，还算是稳步推进中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊走的时候你哭成那个样子，我还怕你也跟着离开御机去龙门呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不至于，不至于。星熊走有她走的原因，我留下也有我留下的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，这才多长时间，羽生萌萌香小姐已经有谈判专家的气质了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胡说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——好烫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"慢点慢点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......烫是烫，但香也是真香啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，森内老板，我可能确实会离开御机一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊说的那个罗德岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕我知道，自己现在已经和萌萌香这个名字绑定得更深，深到了骨子里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我的确也在想，也许，在一个没人认识羽生萌萌香的地方，紫野遥也能短暂地拥有她自己的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少星熊认识你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别打岔，我很认真的啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，知道知道。说不定我也可以去看看，没准能再多交上几个朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森内老板，你说......这样的日子还能持续多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然间怎么了？我不太懂你想说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说不太清，但我总觉得，这样的日子，可能不会太久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你越说我越糊涂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是......怎么说呢，仁田街每晚挤满了人，锻冶町的高楼马上就要封顶，我在街上走，十个人里九个人在聊房价大涨的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的每场演出都能一夜售空，和粉丝握手握到手都脱了一层皮的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总觉得，这样的日子，也许不会太长了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瞎想什么呢，战争？北院打过来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许用不着他们。也许......他们也会被我们卷进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，来电话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是吉星......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，大新闻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？楼市暴跌了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈？你睡醒了吗？今天那个什么新楼盘不是又创新高了吗，哪来的暴跌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是说更纱啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更纱？她不是在哲也走后不久也离开御机了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她给我寄了封信，信纸上还印着家纹，锦织家的家纹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锦织家......北院四大家族的那个锦织家？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她说前一阵子在御机玩得很开心，但是闹得有点大，怕被家里发现，所以回锁川执行灯下黑战术，等风头过了再来找我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这还不算大新闻？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......这新闻的确挺大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吉星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信上还写了你的事，说她得知你在搞演艺事务所，要是真搞成了，她说不定也加盟一下玩一玩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萌萌香","speakerId":"avg_npc_1918_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的事务所？偶像？锦织家的大小姐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森内","speakerId":"avg_4199_makiri_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萌萌香，嘘！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您没有别的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你办事很稳，比三船稳当得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"金石会现在归你管，可金石集团还是个烫手山芋，没什么人想接。有没有兴趣收拾他那些七零八落的遗产，带着金石会再尝试一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了，议员大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也是，收拾他的遗产说说容易，实际做起来，又不知道会有多少艰难险阻在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想这样过一辈子？当一个连老巢都丢了的黑帮的大姐头，直到终老？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也不过是给在社会上无法立足的人硬凑一个家，做些善后工作罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再者，假如御机已经不需要金石会，我也不可能永远这么硬撑下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金石会也好，金石集团也好，我都已经待够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我来，不光是来替三船先生完成他对您的承诺，也是来向您告知......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经尽最大努力为金石会善后，现在特来向您辞行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然你心意已决，我就不强求了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"澪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，多漂亮的姑娘，就可惜长了颗比乌萨斯的冰原还冷的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也是一片好意，她却无论如何不领情，这样的人也算罕见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管那么多了。先看看货。"},{"type":"narration","text":"大腹便便的议员从装潢奢华的会客室站起身，往深处的一扇小门走去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"令人大跌眼镜的是，那扇小门里没有机密文件，也没有金银珠宝。\n那里甚至没有多余的娱乐设施，就和一个普通的邋遢东国人居住的单间没什么区别......\n除了房间中央放着的那台老旧的小钢珠机。\n这台在锻冶町逃过一劫的机器此刻已经接上了专用的电路，亮了起来，发出失真的音乐声。\n刚刚还颇有些威严的议员大人已经迫不及待地坐到机器前面，打算玩上一把。\n他从脚边抓起一筐堆得像小山一样高的小钢珠，打算放进机器里，机器背后忽然传来说话声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"神明的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如愿以偿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的是的，多谢神明大人保佑，我终于如愿以偿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也多谢神明大人时隔多日，终于又愿意出现在我家里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您之前在我家待了那么多年，前两天忽然没了踪影，可把我急坏了！我还以为您弃我于不顾了呢！真是久违了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"神明轻巧地跳上钢珠机的顶端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"折腾了那么大一通，就为了这台机器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可不是！说起来，我因为这台机器发迹，还不是托您的福嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾辈可不记得自己帮你托过什么福。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕后面发生的所有事情您都没有相助，只凭二十年前那件往事，也够我记上一辈子的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是那件事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就是那件事啊，让我从一个废人，从一个社会渣滓，变成一个堂堂正正的人的事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早都说过了，那件事跟吾辈没有关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗐，您又说这话。想想看，那时我是个什么人？整天在家闲着，也不工作，也没书可读......用现在时髦的话，叫——对，啃老族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每天早上找亲妈要钱，去店里打一把小钢珠。赢了我就觉得这一天运气不错，输了，那就是要倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可就在那天，那个改变我命运的日子，我在街上看见了您的身影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那天我从早上赢到晚上，小钢珠像流水一样从机器里吐出来、吐出来、吐出来，整个店里的托盘都不够装我这一台机器赢的钢珠！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后我赢了一大笔，足够去仁田街推车做起小买卖的“一大笔”。毕竟只是小钢珠，我赢的总不可能比那家店值的还多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但您的出现，告诉了我一件事......我不再是废人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从那一天起，我坚信，自己是被您，被您赠给我的运气......被神明眷顾的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果没有您赠给我的运气，我又怎么可能用小钢珠赢来的钱，一步步投机、翻本、勾兑，直到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吾辈赠给你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然是您赠给我的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_i14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就说这几天吧，您不是不在吗？我的事情就办得不顺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我让金兵卫那小子把这台钢珠机给我弄回来。本来是很简单的一件事，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我不可能直接跟他说，于是我说，去把锻冶町拿下，去做个开发计划，顺便去把这台钢珠机弄过来，那东西和我有点因缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后一切就乱了套。锻冶町的黑道，龙门的警察，还有金兵卫自己手底下的艺人......乱成了一锅粥，机器也差点没保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*东国粗口*，要是这台被您眷顾的机器出了什么闪失，把那块河边的烂地建成御机的商业中心，又能有什么用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且不止是我，整个御机......整个南院都受您的眷顾，所以我们才发展得这么快，我们的地产才每天涨个不停，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"北院的土老帽眉毛都要气歪了，可您不愿过去，他们一点办法都没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有您的眷顾，我们一定会越来越好，越来越好，直到......"},{"type":"narration","text":"议员脸上流下一滴汗珠。不是因为紧张，而是因为眉飞色舞地讲了半天，他已经开始觉得热了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"议员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到......永远！"},{"type":"narration","text":"而他眼前的神明，站在钢珠机的顶端俯视着他......\n俯视着这间议员秘密买下，连通向这里的电梯都是VIP专属的三十层高级公寓......\n俯视着将近百米的楼下，喧嚣而嘈杂的御机......\n而后淡淡地吐出一句祂已经说厌了，却鲜少有人当真的话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g15_higashiroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"久违的神明","speakerId":"avg_npc_1903_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和吾辈有什么关系。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"神明轻巧地跳走，离开狭小的斗室，而早已按捺不住，要上机打上一把的议员并未注意到这一点。\n那天之后，他再也没有见过神明的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"64_g7_jinja_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们谈了多长时间了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少三个小时了，一点要结束的意思都没有。我能去上个厕所吗，马上回来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还想跑是吗？在御机闯了这么大的祸，八大家的家主你一人引来两个，还差点引发南北纠纷，你知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我家老爷子也就算了，您毕竟也是一方宫司，叶家那头老鹿再怎么说也不能拿你怎么样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕不是八大家族，论血脉您也绝对不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"口无遮拦！哪怕你自己不想活了，也不要连累你那些朋友们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然还给朋友们寄信，说自己要回锁川搞什么灯下黑？要不是你一直在这儿，咳，土下座，现在连他们都要危险了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不也说什么用生命担保萌萌香他们绝无异心，肯定是好人之类的。您这么急公好义，我就去上个厕所——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别恭维我了。一会儿叶和锦织两家的家主出来，你要是在这儿还好说，要是跑了......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子饿了吗？饿了我这儿有竹轮，先凑合吃点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，宫司大人，我听神社的人说，您有个女儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，比你小一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您会不会像刚刚凶我一样凶她啊？"},{"type":"narration","text":"神职愣了一愣，像是看什么不可理喻、无法交流的生物一样看了更纱一眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？凶丽萨？你在想什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟她不是也像我一样偷偷溜走了吗？我好歹还在东国境内呢，她据说都跑到叙拉古去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个嘛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的神职","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次你要是见到英格丽，让她跟你慢慢解释吧——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"门忽然开了。\n万幸更纱提前意识到门缝里传来的光线有变，在千钧一发之际回归了土下座的姿势。\n而宫司也立刻会意，挺直脊背，低下头颅，侍立一旁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，请再次容许我代表锦织家向您，向叶家致歉。锦织家管教后辈无方，给叶家添了麻烦，万分抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亚女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您言重了。大事都已谈妥，我还要感谢令爱给了我们双方一个当面交流的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亚女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"御机出了如此颟顸无能的议员，纵容暴力团逞凶，令爱也是路见不平而已，何错之有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃拉菲亚女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"至于您好奇的神明行踪......恕我冒昧，暂且还是顺其自然，最为妥当......"},{"type":"narration","text":"两位家主缓缓走过神社的庭园，走向神域的出口，仿佛全然未曾注意到，自己身后还有一跪一站的两个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"更纱","speakerId":"avg_npc_1900_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......算是平安过关了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的宫司","speakerId":"avg_npc_1902_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑且算是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈尔男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更纱，该回家了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"苍老的阿戈尔男性站定在神社的入口处，若无其事地唤了一声。\n更纱愣了半晌，原本因逃过一劫而高兴得通红的脸颊一下子白了下去。\n她抬头看了看神社这方被圈起来的天空，闭上双眼，在自以为父亲看不到的地方握紧了拳头......\n然后，换上一副乖巧而木然的表情，小步跟上父亲，缓缓离去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
